agic]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!fbazY4sHSTB4vW4l.lYvWF5v5Vah9KWsN"},{"_id":"aMNM0X0dVvVRdlZT","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Vulnerable to Neutralize Poison","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>Casting @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0]{Cleanse Affliction} on the golem deactivates its Breath Weapon for 1 minute.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!fbazY4sHSTB4vW4l.aMNM0X0dVvVRdlZT"},{"_id":"SJraLZmz7x1C04ki","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Vulnerable to Rust","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>Magical rusting effects, like a rust monster's antennae, affect the iron golem normally.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!fbazY4sHSTB4vW4l.SJraLZmz7x1C04ki"},{"_id":"HkUjt1e6CiwdfHoy","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Breath Weapon","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The iron golem exhales poisonous gas in a @Template[burst|distance:10]{10-foot radius} centered on the corner of one of the iron golem's squares.</p>\n<p>The gas persists for 1 round. Any creature in the area (or that later enters the area) is exposed to the iron golem's poison.</p>\n<p>The golem can't use its Breath Weapon again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Breath Weapon]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["arcane","poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!fbazY4sHSTB4vW4l.HkUjt1e6CiwdfHoy"},{"_id":"yhVKDXeyQEVchPJW","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Dismember","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Whenever Mr. Snips rolls a critical hit with a scissors Strike, in addition to dealing extra damage, the golem has a chance to dismember its victim. The target must roll a @Check[reflex|dc:39|traits:damaging-effect] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> No additional effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[2d10[bleed]].</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and one of the targets extremities is severed (the effects of this are up to the GM's discretion).</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"Note","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"scissors-attack","text":"{item|system.description.value}","title":"{item|name}","visibility":"owner"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!fbazY4sHSTB4vW4l.yhVKDXeyQEVchPJW"},{"_id":"nhz5F428cTKGkc9v","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Inexorable March","sort":800000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The iron golem Strides up to its Speed, pushing back each creature whose space it moves into and damaging them if they try to stop its movement. A creature can attempt to bar the way by succeeding at a @Check[fortitude|dc:39] save. On a critical success, the resisting creature takes no damage; otherwise, it is damaged as if hit by the golem's fist.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!fbazY4sHSTB4vW4l.nhz5F428cTKGkc9v"},{"_id":"RSzJjCjwpz8jIS3J","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Iron Golem Poison","sort":900000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Any @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained} value from this poison is reduced by 1 every hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:35]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[4d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[8d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 3} (1 round)</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!fbazY4sHSTB4vW4l.RSzJjCjwpz8jIS3J"}],"name":"Mr. Snips","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":-5},"con":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":-1},"int":{"mod":-5},"str":{"mod":8},"wis":{"mod":0}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":36},"adjustment":"","allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":210,"temp":0,"value":210},"immunities":[{"type":"fire"},{"type":"magic"}],"resistances":[{"exceptions":["adamantine"],"type":"physical","value":15}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[],"value":20}},"details":{"blurb":"Elite variant iron golem","languages":{"details":"","value":[]},"level":{"value":14},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Traditionally crafted into the forms of giant suits of armor or powerful animals, iron golems are products of exquisite artistry and skill. Their articulated joints and sturdy armored bodies require great care and mathematical precision to craft, and regular cleaning and oiling ensure they don't rust over the ages. With proper care, iron golems can remain in good shape for thousands of years, being passed down for generations, as long as they aren't destroyed by meddlesome adventurers. In addition to their incredible strength, iron golems possess a potent toxic breath weapon that is often more than enough to dispatch entire groups of opponents.</p>","publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder #161: Belly of the Black Whale"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":23,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":28},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":23},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":24}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":32}},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"lg"},"value":["construct","golem","mindless"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.agents-of-edgewatch-bestiary.Actor.Wk2T0Wr8Sebo4br5"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!fbazY4sHSTB4vW4l","prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/agents-of-edgewatch-bestiary/mr-snips.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"agents_of_edgewatch_bestiary__mr_snips","sourcePack":"pf2e.agents-of-edgewatch-bestiary","sourceDocId":"Wk2T0Wr8Sebo4br5"}}}